DATA NOTICE: face

Data files tracked by DVC in this directory (fetch with `dvc pull`):
  dataset.tar.gz -> Face.pgm, class.txt, info.txt

What:
  Face.pgm: a 1280x626 grayscale copy of the 1927 Solvay Conference
  group photograph. class.txt and info.txt: OpenCV's frontal-face
  Haar cascade (25 stages, 2,913 weak classifiers) converted to
  fixed-point integers.

Source:
  Face.pgm: "Solvay conference 1927" by Benjamin Couprie, Institut
  International de Physique Solvay, Brussels, 1927.
    https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Solvay_conference_1927.jpg
  (original 3000x2171; converted to grayscale and resized, saved with GIMP)

  class.txt, info.txt: OpenCV
  data/haarcascades/haarcascade_frontalface_default.xml, created by
  Rainer Lienhart, https://github.com/opencv/opencv. The stage sizes,
  rectangles, thresholds (x4096) and leaf values (x256) match that
  file (checked 2026-11-19).

  Benchmark code: Viola-Jones face detection by Francesco Comaschi,
  TU Eindhoven (5KK73 GPU course, 2012),
  https://sites.google.com/site/5kk73gpu2012/assignment/viola-jones-face-detection

